{"updated":"2026-11-28T17:02:50.379Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: Netanyahu proposes rival Eisenkot serve as first PM in rotating premiership. Elsewhere, argentina's bid to stop Falklands oil drilling rejected. And trump crackdown shatters US hopes for Guatemalans displaced by climate crisis. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on Ukraine, at active conflict levels, though Iran, and US are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, felt the weight of it — the S&P 500 down 5.5 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial down 3.1 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite down 8.9 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 40 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 6.7 near 62 km NNW of Yelizovo, Russia. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.12,0.17,0.22,0.26,0.3,0.35,0.4,0.43,0.48,0.52,0.56,0.59,0.63,0.65,0.7,0.82,0.92,1.07,1.31,1.43,1.47,1.51,1.53,1.58,1.6,1.63,1.65,1.71,1.75,1.85,1.9,1.95,1.99,2.03,2.08,2.11,2.15,2.21,2.26,2.31,2.35,2.39,2.44,2.48,2.53,2.58,2.63,2.71,2.77,2.89,2.98,3.16,3.18,3.22,3.25,3.31,3.35,3.41,3.53,3.61,3.67,3.74,3.79,3.84,3.89,3.94,3.98,4,4.03,4.09,4.11,4.13,4.16,4.2,4.25,4.33,4.39,4.45,4.52,4.57,4.64,4.68,4.74,4.76,4.82,4.93,5.06,5.24,5.68,5.75,5.83,5.9,5.97,6.01,6.07,6.22,6.34,6.41,6.48,6.53,6.57,6.62,6.69,6.78,6.86,6.98,7.01,7.09,7.16,7.26,7.31,7.37,7.43,7.5,7.57,7.69,7.74,7.84,7.91,7.99,8.14,8.22,8.39,8.49,8.6,8.65,8.7,8.73,8.78,8.82,8.86,8.94,8.99,9.07,9.13,9.18,9.22,9.29,9.36,9.68,10.07,10.16,10.21,10.28,10.32,10.4,10.48,10.6,10.67,10.73,10.76,10.79,10.86,10.9,10.95,11.01,11.05,11.1,11.13,11.18,11.24,11.29,11.37,11.46,11.61,12.21,12.33,12.39,12.45,12.49,12.54,12.6,12.63,12.69,12.84,12.88,13.03,13.12,13.19,13.26,13.33,13.36,13.45,13.53,13.6,13.65,13.7,13.72,13.78,13.83,13.94,14,14.05,14.08,14.12,14.19,14.23,14.29,14.37,14.43,14.52,14.56,14.63,14.68